# Template only. Generate the real file with:  python3 scripts/make_dummy_backup.py   (writes data/backup.env)
# A dummy Sentinel backup with an EMPTY payload, encrypted under a random password that is thrown
# away, so it can only exercise the wrong-password / corrupt-backup errors (SET-05, SET-06).
# DUMMY_BACKUP_NET is the same blob plus the #404 envelope declaration "network":"mainnet"
# (exercises the import preview line's network segment); DUMMY_SAMOURAI_SHAPE is an inert
# {"external","payload"} carrier that classifies as a Samourai backup and previews as
# "Valid backup file" - no key material in any of the four blobs.
DUMMY_BACKUP=<{"version":2,"time":...,"payload":"U2FsdGVkX1..."} JSON blob on one line>
DUMMY_BACKUP_TRUNC=<the same blob cut in half>
DUMMY_BACKUP_NET=<{"version":2,"time":...,"payload":"U2FsdGVkX1...","network":"mainnet"} JSON blob on one line>
DUMMY_SAMOURAI_SHAPE=<{"external":"zero-key-material","payload":"Salted__..."} JSON blob on one line>
